---
// Sección 03 — El ciclo (diagrama circular)
// Desktop (≥700px): diagrama circular SVG con animación de aparición
// Mobile (<700px): chips lineales
// Transición emocional — sin botones, sin CTA.
---

<section data-screen-label="03 El ciclo" style="padding: clamp(72px, 12vw, 140px) 0;">
  <div
    style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: clamp(32px, 5vw, 52px); text-align: center;"
  >
    <!-- DESKTOP: diagrama circular SVG -->
    <div class="ciclo-amplio" style="position: relative; width: min(100%, 560px); aspect-ratio: 1;">
      <svg
        viewBox="0 0 400 400"
        aria-hidden="true"
        style="position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow: visible;"
      >
        <path
          d="M 234 6.9 A 196 196 0 0 1 393 166"
          fill="none"
          stroke="var(--fg-1)"
          stroke-opacity="0.16"
          stroke-width="1.5"></path>
        <path
          d="M 393 234 A 196 196 0 0 1 234 393"
          fill="none"
          stroke="var(--fg-1)"
          stroke-opacity="0.16"
          stroke-width="1.5"></path>
        <path
          d="M 166 393 A 196 196 0 0 1 7 234"
          fill="none"
          stroke="var(--fg-1)"
          stroke-opacity="0.16"
          stroke-width="1.5"></path>
        <path
          d="M 7 166 A 196 196 0 0 1 166 6.9"
          fill="none"
          stroke="var(--accent-ink)"
          stroke-opacity="0.55"
          stroke-width="1.5"
          stroke-dasharray="5 7"></path>
        <polygon
          points="0,-5.5 11,0 0,5.5"
          fill="var(--fg-1)"
          fill-opacity="0.32"
          transform="translate(339 61) rotate(45)"></polygon>
        <polygon
          points="0,-5.5 11,0 0,5.5"
          fill="var(--fg-1)"
          fill-opacity="0.32"
          transform="translate(339 339) rotate(135)"></polygon>
        <polygon
          points="0,-5.5 11,0 0,5.5"
          fill="var(--fg-1)"
          fill-opacity="0.32"
          transform="translate(61 339) rotate(225)"></polygon>
        <polygon
          points="0,-5.5 11,0 0,5.5"
          fill="var(--accent-ink)"
          transform="translate(108 32.7) rotate(330)"></polygon>
      </svg>
      <span data-anim class="cycle-node cycle-node-top">Abres el chat</span>
      <span data-anim class="cycle-node cycle-node-right">Preguntas</span>
      <span data-anim class="cycle-node cycle-node-bottom">Copias</span>
      <span data-anim class="cycle-node cycle-node-left">Pegas</span>
      <span data-anim class="cycle-loop-label">mañana, otra vez</span>
      <p class="cycle-center">Nadie te enseñó a exigirle más de una respuesta suelta.</p>
    </div>

    <p
      style="margin: 0; max-width: 46ch; font-size: clamp(14px, 1.8vw, 16.5px); line-height: 1.6; color: var(--fg-3); text-wrap: pretty;"
    >
      Otros, en tu mismo trabajo y con la misma herramienta, ya lo automatizaron.
    </p>

    <!-- MOBILE: chips lineales (activo solo en <700px vía CSS) -->
    <div class="ciclo-compacto">
      <div
        style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"
      >
        <span class="cycle-chip">Abres el chat</span>
        <span style="color: var(--fg-4);">→</span>
        <span class="cycle-chip">Preguntas</span>
        <span style="color: var(--fg-4);">→</span>
        <span class="cycle-chip">Copias</span>
        <span style="color: var(--fg-4);">→</span>
        <span class="cycle-chip">Pegas</span>
        <span style="color: var(--accent-ink); font-size: 15px;">↺</span>
        <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent-ink);">
          mañana, otra vez
        </span>
      </div>
      <p
        style="margin: 12px auto 0; max-width: 24ch; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: -0.015em; color: var(--fg-1);"
      >
        Nadie te enseñó a exigirle más de una respuesta suelta.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Cita al pie -->
    <div
      style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding-top: clamp(8px, 2vw, 16px); border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); width: min(100%, 620px);"
    >
      <p
        style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-style: italic; font-weight: 500; font-size: clamp(20px, 4vw, 34px); line-height: 1.25; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--fg-1);"
      >
        "La uso, pero no le saco todo el jugo"
      </p>
      <span class="caption" style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--fg-3);">
        la frase que más repiten los profesionales antes de tomar este curso
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cycle-node {
    position: absolute;
    white-space: nowrap;
    background: var(--bg-0);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    padding: 9px 18px;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(14px, 1.6vw, 18px);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--fg-1);
    animation: tribuFade 0.5s ease-out both;
  }
  .cycle-node-top {
    top: 0;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    animation-delay: 0.05s;
  }
  .cycle-node-right {
    top: 50%;
    left: 100%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    animation-delay: 0.22s;
  }
  .cycle-node-bottom {
    top: 100%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    animation-delay: 0.39s;
  }
  .cycle-node-left {
    top: 50%;
    left: 0;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    animation-delay: 0.56s;
  }
  .cycle-loop-label {
    position: absolute;
    top: 15.5%;
    left: 15.5%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-45deg);
    white-space: nowrap;
    background: var(--bg-0);
    padding: 3px 9px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    font-size: clamp(12px, 1.3vw, 14px);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    animation: tribuFade 0.5s ease-out 0.73s both;
  }
  .cycle-center {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    margin: 0;
    width: 54%;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(16px, 2.4vw, 23px);
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    color: var(--fg-1);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .cycle-chip {
    background: var(--bg-0);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    padding: 7px 13px;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--fg-1);
  }

  /* Fallback móvil: mostrar chips en <700px, ocultar diagrama circular */
  .ciclo-compacto {
    display: none;
  }
  @media (max-width: 699px) {
    .ciclo-amplio {
      display: none;
    }
    .ciclo-compacto {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 18px;
    }
  }
</style>
